# Google Maps API Key
# Used for Geocoding and Places API in development and production.
# Get your restricted API key at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#
# For React Native (JavaScript):
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# For Android Native SDK:
# You can also add MAPS_API_KEY=your_key to android/local.properties (which is gitignored)
